# Trail capture receipt (search wiring W1): three navigations through the
# real shell land as BrowsingTrace segments in the session's memory store.
# The exit hook flushes the open segment when the scenario's Done exits the
# loop, so this needs no segment-filling. Network-free by design: mere://
# addresses are graph-native and open without a fetch. FRESH profile.
settle 30
key escape

open mere://alpha
settle 10
open mere://beta
settle 10
open mere://gamma
settle 10
capture 01_three_navigations
